# Adaptio ERP Design System

When building or modifying any UI in this ERP, follow these exact patterns. Reference: DirectoryCustomers page, `docs/components/ui/index.ts`, and `src/styles/global.css`.

---

## Brand Colors (CSS Variables — never hardcode hex)

| Token | Variable | Value | Usage |
|-------|----------|-------|-------|
| Primary | `--primary-brand-hex` | `#008DD2` | Buttons (Add, Create, Save), links, active tabs, focus rings |
| Primary Hover | `--primary-brand-hover` | `#00678d` | Primary button :hover |
| Secondary | `--secondary-brand-hex` / `--neutral-gray` | `#5C8DA6` | Inactive badges, secondary text |
| Save & Close | `--save-close-hex` | `#27ae60` | "Save and Close" button only |
| Graphite Black | `--graphite-black-hex` | `#333333` | Main body text |
| Sidebar BG | `--navy-900` | `#0D202D` | Sidebar background |
| Sidebar Base | `--sidebar-base` | `#404a63` | Sidebar principal; tab underline, active accent |
| Sidebar Hover | `--navy-800` | `#132B3B` | Sidebar item hover |

## Status Colors (for badges)

| Status | Variable | BG Class | Text Class |
|--------|----------|----------|------------|
| Active / Success | `--status-green` `#27ae60` | `bg-green-50` | `text-status-green` |
| Info / Primary | `--status-cyan` `#008DD2` | `bg-cyan-50` | `text-status-cyan` |
| Sent / Open | `--status-blue` `#2563eb` | `bg-blue-50` | `text-blue-700` |
| Warning / On Hold | `--status-yellow` | `bg-orange-50` | `text-orange-700` |
| Error / Cancelled | `--status-red` `#b91c1c` | `bg-red-50` | `text-red-700` |
| Inactive / Draft | `--status-gray` `#5C8DA6` | `bg-gray-50` | `text-status-gray` |
| Archived | `--status-purple` `#9333ea` | `bg-purple-50` | `text-purple-700` |
| In Production | — | `bg-indigo-50` | `text-indigo-700` |

## Typography

- **Font family**: `Inter, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif` (via `--font-family`)
- **Body text**: `14px` (`text-sm`) — default for all body content
- **Small text**: `12px` (`text-xs`) — table headers, badges, pagination, captions
- **Heading**: `16px` — section headings inside pages
- **Page title**: `20px` (`text-xl font-semibold text-foreground`)
- **Card title**: `text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900`
- **Subtitle/count**: `text-xs` + `color: var(--gray-500)`
- **Label**: `text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 mb-0.5`

## Logos and app chrome

- **Logos**: Use **gray** for all app logos and chrome icons (sidebar logo, user avatar in top bar). Do not use brand color (primary-brand-hex) for these; keep them neutral: `color: 'var(--gray-500)'` for icons, `backgroundColor: 'var(--gray-500)'` for avatar circles. This keeps a consistent neutral chrome; brand color is for primary actions and links only.

## Border Radius

All border-radius is `0` (square corners) via Tailwind config. Use `rounded-lg` only for cards/containers (maps to `0`). For pill badges, use `rounded-full` explicitly.

## Spacing

- **Page padding**: `py-6 px-6` (content area). Wrap list content in `max-w-6xl mx-auto` so container width matches detail pages (DetailPageLayout uses `max-w-6xl` for header, tabs, and content).
- **Card padding**: `p-6` (standard), `p-4` (compact), `p-3` (tight)
- **Table header cells**: `py-3 px-4`
- **Table body cells**: `py-4 px-4`
- **Gap between items**: `gap-3` (buttons), `gap-2` (icons), `gap-1` (tight actions)
- **Margin below header**: `mb-6`
- **Margin below search/filter bar**: `mb-4`

