## Component Patterns

### Page Header
- **Header actions**: Always align to the right (pegado al padding derecho). Use `ml-auto` on the actions container: `className="flex items-center gap-3 ml-auto"`.
```tsx
<div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
  <div>
    <h1 className="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mb-1">Page Title</h1>
    <p className="text-xs" style={{ color: 'var(--gray-500)' }}>X items</p>
  </div>
  <div className="flex items-center gap-3 ml-auto">
    {/* Secondary button */}
    <button className="flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1 border border-gray-300 rounded bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors text-sm">
      <Icon className="w-4 h-4" /> Import
    </button>
    {/* Primary button */}
    <button className="flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1 rounded text-white transition-colors text-sm hover:opacity-90"
      style={{ backgroundColor: 'var(--primary-brand-hex)' }}>
      <Plus className="w-4 h-4" /> Add Item
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
```

