### Action Buttons (in table rows)
- **All row actions** (View, Edit, Delete/Trash, Link, etc.) use the **same gray style**: `text-gray-600`, `hover:bg-gray-100`, `p-1.5`, icon 14px (`style={{ width: 14, height: 14 }}`). Do **not** use red for delete/trash; keep it neutral gray like the rest of the chrome.
- **Alignment**: The Actions column content must be **pegado al padding derecho**: use `text-right` on the cell and `justify-end` on the flex container so the group of icons (and the last icon, Delete) sits against the right padding.
- **Header “Eliminar seleccionados”** (bulk delete): use secondary button style — `border border-gray-300 rounded bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50`, icon 14px.

```tsx
<th className="text-right py-3 px-4 font-medium text-gray-700 text-xs">Actions</th>
// ...
<td className="py-4 px-4 text-right">
  <div className="flex items-center gap-1 justify-end">
    <button className="p-1.5 hover:bg-gray-100 rounded text-gray-600" title="Edit">
      <Edit style={{ width: 14, height: 14 }} />
    </button>
    <button className="p-1.5 hover:bg-gray-100 rounded text-gray-600" title="Delete">
      <Trash2 style={{ width: 14, height: 14 }} />
    </button>
  </div>
</td>
```

