### Tab Styles (Module Tabs & StatusTabs)

**Unified pattern:** Gray bar + white active tab ("sobresalir en blanco") + underline color from sidebar.

| Element | Style |
|---------|-------|
| **Container** | `bg-gray-100`, `border-b border-gray-200` |
| **Active tab** | `bg-white` (sobresalir en blanco), `font-semibold`, `borderBottom: 2px solid var(--sidebar-base)` |
| **Inactive tab** | `hover:bg-white/50`, `font-normal`, `borderBottom: 2px solid transparent` |
| **Text** | `color: #1c1f26`, `fontSize: 12px` |

**Important:** Underline uses `var(--sidebar-base)` (#404a63), not primary brand. Active tab "sobresale" in white over the gray bar.

